# The texts of the shell in nl-NL (WP-S2.08 D12): every key of `../en-GB/shell.ftl`, with the same `{ $p0 }`,
# `{ $p1 }`, ... arguments. A message missing here falls back to en-GB. Product and file names, rule IDs, command
# names, key caps, identifiers and units are not translated.
#
# The terminology table (D12; IEC 60050 and NEN-EN-IEC 81346 usage, the glossary `glossary/glossary.toml`). One row
# per term, `# term: <en-GB> = <nl-NL> (not: <rejected>, ...)`; a test reads it and checks the messages below.
# term: device = apparaat (not: toestel, component)
# term: function = functie
# term: terminal = klem (not: aansluitklem)
# term: connection point = aansluitpunt (not: connectiepunt)
# term: connection = verbinding
# term: wire = draad (not: kabel)
# term: wire colour = aderkleur (not: draadkleur)
# term: wire marker = adermarkering
# term: interruption point = onderbrekingspunt (not: onderbreekpunt)
# term: terminal strip = klemmenstrook (not: klemmenblok, klemmenrij)
# term: potential = potentiaal (not: potentieel)
# term: part = artikel (not: onderdeel)
# term: messages = meldingen (not: berichten)
# term: tag = kenmerk
# term: structure node = structuurknooppunt
# term: basic project = basisproject
# term: title block = titelblok
# term: page = pagina
# term: cross-section = doorsnede
# term: frame and title block = kader en titelblok
# term: main and auxiliary function = hoofd- en hulpfunctie
# term: structure box = structuurkader
# term: report block = rapportblok
# term: black box = black box
# term: cross-reference = kruisverwijzing
# term: cable = kabel
# term: core = ader
# term: frame = kader
# term: finding = bevinding
# term: waiver = vrijstelling
# term: notification = notificatie
# term: symbol = symbool
# term: library = bibliotheek
# term: enclosure = kast
# term: carrier = drager
# term: revision = revisie
# term: layout = layout (not: lay-out)
# term: strip editor = klemmenstrookeditor (not: strookeditor)
# term: duct = kabelgoot (not: goot)
# term: frozen = vastgezet (not: bevroren)
# term: unfreeze = losmaken (not: ontdooien)
# term: numbering scheme = nummeringsschema
# term: bond = potentiaalverbinding
# term: placeholder part = tijdelijk artikel (not: plaatsvervangend artikel)
# term: merge driver = samenvoegdriver (not: mergedriver)
# term: parts list = stuklijst
# term: valve terminal = ventieleiland
# term: valve slot = ventielplaats (not: ventielpositie)
# term: equipotential bond = potentiaalvereffening
# term: shield bond = afschermingsverbinding
# term: FE–PE bond = FE–PE-verbinding
# term: 0 V–PE bond = 0 V–PE-verbinding

